    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb956f23637fa0377e72b080",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然神业对这种状况很兴奋，\n但作为训练员的我心情稍微有点复杂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6c6802c7915c2d5b053793d9b35a714fb0ff679b7c92f61b7be054390a28cac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f5896e79c37d068f2160d32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（没想到会变成这种状况……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0281d970d3aae0d8a0948e71dcac4b906b74db8a10e77a37678409266b52f4d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c1895c24076d742a138ef4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对神业这样充满魅力的赛马娘，能否展示出自己是\n『能引导她走向梦想的训练员』，并以此连接到担当契约呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e0ac759f611e9501672ebf170c94d17be1b2c8f6c435c4be7988bfe87c5dc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b506b55750993e6eaecdff81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也要，全力地面对她！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c962a8e7acff704fe2ce627ebcaea5b56ac9e33196084333fae66b92c0020b8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137003.json",
