    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8613db31422dc86ed905895f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "锵！这是下一个新必杀技！其名为『离心力回避』！！\n进入弯道后手扶内侧护栏，咕咕——地转弯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "316e34f922fc8fdd1760a89de0ca25728484c51a2282d42d95ee50f81b5253a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
