    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f62bbab3ce190f0f3042e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接触内侧护栏的策略，从安全面和规则面来看都很严峻吧。\n但是那个着眼于过弯的关注点很有趣。既然如此……――",
      "source_fingerprint": "db865ecaa53dcb55adb4b8865831fe622fb41288f27a50ac401b7750c7b93d2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
