      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不对，不对不对！　神业能撑住吗！？\n那种“领放”什么的，至今为止的训练中一次也没……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c64950eb1d162737eb0200af7902326d4864433730dd030b8d45ff89e8aefa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10fdec9774cd486c92ec8f92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，她的最佳跑法会随比赛而变化",
      "source_fingerprint": "891dec2c0a57eaf3b866cab1fe619d5675036123f211ddfb28d682d539270727",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd95f3033684543035f810c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中坚训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a34931cc602589e873be74227a6e41b3d1912d31684f0db4e6ce1da01bd519",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9733bfb20b790e4c6863b38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那、那肯定会让人心跳加速啊！　等等！\n也就是说你的方针，是让神业转型为“领放”吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84e260c143f64940203556b9244d9bb3082f64efc9e80d435aee55c2d6fd8aa0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad6f3d38f6843e6eeb36b07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业所追求的，是让那场比赛变得最有趣的跑法。\n然后在变得有趣的比赛中获得胜利――成为主人公。",
      "source_fingerprint": "680472fc49941ee181f9ff3a635a6c8d354fdb0f380412bfc2680aa0d6ee815e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c07485944364be2d4e48ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以这是，仅为了这一次模拟赛的跑法。\n能让人觉得最有趣，为了让她获胜的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71caa403a24ff5210dcbe00e867b0982cfe3ea488532e7df6b7fdd3ac5203fad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e63d04f31f7eecb545b30a83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "资深训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0e5584c3cb99d8bdca31a777c0c8b05644dd3c6a9cdf1918b8423e3053861bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98c0ae626fec230b17b5ec15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……太、太愚蠢了！　比赛获胜的定式，是赛马娘\n要巩固自己的胜利路线！　可是……――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e75ad8bdb67e79c19442564e0d28c54b6c748c4dda981a27d803b2a9a1eda1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e14ba147128ccf5e4c30d0ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错！她的奔跑将会让人无法移开视线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03f960141befdf4d78cdbdeb3bf6458174a3d0a98dd617c626e4678762e5211",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d7e218ccbfee20968aa63c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "资深训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0e5584c3cb99d8bdca31a777c0c8b05644dd3c6a9cdf1918b8423e3053861bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
