    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f10095f5b3b9e553a49bcaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "用和上次截然不同的跑法，真的能行吗……？\n那种事情……――，如果那种“万一”能实现的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1776391872bf93a566c2c749b6f27637661a5eff412f4f22237c0b1974e43e55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd238a10bf89aa09c00b496",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在观众席上，和被她的奔跑吸引住目光的训练员们一起，\n守望着神业。守望着在强豪面前继续着鲁莽独旅的她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c224663c0e82c95dd873fdbacd5d43b760bb439e846329711963b957afd2d6af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1137/storytimeline_041137004.json",
      "json_path": [
