      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:917e71aacb74681f8a94265e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那样的奔跑对后方的赛马娘们来说，也作为意外的一招生效了。\n大家都在看着她的背影。大家，都对她――",
      "source_fingerprint": "41870a10329b379ba0707deae873f61963842a6560bb8986117adc23d05b130c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
